OL,3,GNEWSAWork on Hull roundabouts to
OL,4,Acontinue until spring
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe completion of work on two
OL,7,Froundabouts in Hull has been delayed
OL,8,Funtil next March.
OL,10,FThe city council had anticipated the
OL,11,Fwork on the roundabout near Ennerdale
OL,12,FLeisure Centre and on the Wawne
OL,13,FRoad/Bude Road roundabout in Bransholme
OL,14,Fbeing completed by the end of this
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,17,FThe council said the change of plan was
OL,18,Fdue to a "combination of delays to
OL,19,Futility diversion works and additional
OL,20,Futility requirements".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
